 the major streaming companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/the-trade-desk-ttd-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2024-06-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Laura Schenkein","x":"Thanks to our careful management of operating expenses in recent years, we are well-positioned to innovate our platform, invest in cutting-edge technologies like AI, expand our teams, and further distance ourselves from competitors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/the-trade-desk-ttd-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2024-09-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"You may recall, three or four years ago, I would talk on these calls about inventory scarcity, especially in CTV in the fourth quarter, which was enjoying a significant surge because of people spending more time streaming at home during the global pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2024-09-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"As advertisers chased those viewer eyeballs to new streaming platforms, advertising inventory was scarce and with demand rising, CPMs went up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2024-09-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"One simple way to frame this relevance to our world is that inflation is measured primarily using price increases implemented by our clients on products we advertise for around the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q4","e":"ttd","d":"2024-12-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"I would argue that higher CPMs through more efficient supply chains are the only way most of the streamers will get to sustainable and scaling profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/the-trade-desk-ttd-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q4","e":"ttd","d":"2024-12-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"In order to do that, almost all of the streaming leaders have deployed UID2 as a way of providing advertisers with precision and addressability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/the-trade-desk-ttd-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q4","e":"ttd","d":"2024-12-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"The second major accompanying initiative I want to talk about is the investments we're making in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/the-trade-desk-ttd-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q4","e":"ttd","d":"2024-12-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"Over and over again, we are finding new opportunities to make AI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/the-trade-desk-ttd-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2024 Q4","e":"ttd","d":"2024-12-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"I think there's a lot of inefficiencies in the supply chain, but now we're just at the right size where we can change it, where we're big enough to create changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/the-trade-desk-ttd-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2025-08-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"If you fast forward through the impact of a global pandemic, now all live sports are available via streaming TV, and represent one of the most valuable pillars of the open Internet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Schenkein","x":"Turning to our outlook, assuming the macro environment remains stable and we don't see disruptions from large global brands, which make up a significant portion of our business due to tariff uncertainty, we expect Q3 revenues to be at least $717 million reflecting 14% year-over-year growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"Some have to respond more than others to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2025-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"And this, of course, is competing with Netflix and Disney and Paramount, all of the streamers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/trade-desk-ttd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"…consumer products or CPG, and then parts of retail are still feeling pressure from factors like tariffs and inflation and in some cases it's also a legacy mindset around advertising that still leans on cheap reach of user-generated content and sometimes even more legacy than that the cheap…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/trade-desk-ttd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Green","x":"Streamlining our go-to-market organization, improving coordination across regions and teams, and instilling stronger operating cadences that enhance accountability and performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/trade-desk-ttd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2025 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Toth","x":"If there are any trends that you see that you know, will benefit The Trade Desk next year, and how your restructuring positions you to benefit from those trends next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/trade-desk-ttd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Terry Green","x":"They are investing in and leveraging AI tools like Koa.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tahnil Davis","x":"During the quarter, we continued to make investments in our team and platform, particularly in areas like platform operations as we optimize our platform infrastructure and implement more AI-powered tools in our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Terry Green","x":"Global economic pressures, wars, and tariffs have created an environment that is harder for some brands and some brand categories to grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tahnil Davis","x":"Automotive remains an area of strength overall, though we believe this business could be growing faster absent the impact of increased tariffs on the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Terry Green","x":"We are seeing more cooperation from the biggest publishers in the world, as they are highly in tune with the fact that they need higher CPMs that come from biddable and there is not really any way out for them in terms of raising prices, or adding to the ad load.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Terry Green","x":"Common examples include bad measurement methodologies and an overreliance on cost cutting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q1","e":"ttd","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Terry Green","x":"They also know, often by experience, that cost cutting does not fuel growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/the-trade-desk-ttd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nathan Olmstead","x":"The increase in Q2 was driven primarily by platform operations as we optimize platform infrastructure, implement more AI-powered tools on our platform and continue to evolve our various decisioning and data offerings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"And that's why we've been investing in AI for years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"Autos and CPG have both been set back by tariffs and oil prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"General Motors described a multibillion-dollar impact from tariffs in addition to plans to onshore production to avoid future tariff risk.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"We are enhancing navigation, streamlining workflows and troubleshooting and delivering a more intuitive user experience from end to end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"So I wouldn't say that the DSP model, if you will, is going to be disrupted by AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q2","e":"ttd","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"So we view this -- the injection of AI is not a question or not a disruption, but in fact, the very essence of what it means to be a DSP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/trade-desk-ttd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2026-11-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"And as linear TV goes away and becomes less and less relevant relative to streaming, brands will win or lose based on their ability to understand and use data-driven advertising.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"We've continued to invest in the platform, AI, measurement and data, and we're creating systems and processes that allow us to operate at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2026-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nathan Olmstead","x":"The quarter included $44 million of restructuring charges, primarily related to severance and other employee benefits associated with the organizational actions we announced in September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2026-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nathan Olmstead","x":"Excluding stock-based compensation and restructuring charges, Q3 operating expenses were $504 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TTD 2026 Q3","e":"ttd","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Green","x":"AI is fueling change and disruption, but our AI, joined with the trust and partnership we've built over many years, makes it especially valuable to The Trade Desk.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/the-trade-desk-ttd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[57,1,10072,0,0,0,9084,712],[58,1,10739,0,0,0,9480,880],[59,1,10861,0,0,0,9969,654],[62,1,10343,0,0,0,9355,679],[63,1,9555,0,0,0,9319,148],[65,1,9579,0,0,0,8422,817],[66,1,9988,0,0,0,8982,796],[67,1,9988,0,0,0,8863,886]],"cinema":[[57,1,10072,0,0,0,9084,712],[58,1,10739,0,0,0,9480,880],[59,1,10861,0,0,0,9969,654],[62,1,10343,0,0,0,9355,679],[63,1,9555,0,0,0,9319,148],[65,1,9579,0,0,0,8422,817],[66,1,9988,0,0,0,8982,796],[67,1,9988,0,0,0,8863,886]],"imax":[[57,1,10072,0,0,0,9084,712],[58,1,10739,0,0,0,9480,880],[59,1,10861,0,0,0,9969,654],[62,1,10343,0,0,0,9355,679],[63,1,9555,0,0,0,9319,148],[65,1,9579,0,0,0,8422,817],[66,1,9988,0,0,0,8982,796],[67,1,9988,0,0,0,8863,886]],"streaming":[[57,1,10072,